        {
          "caption": "Quantitative differences in the N-glycome of isolated cardiomyocytes from COVID-19(+) and COVID-19(\u2212) patients. A, compositional analysis of N-glycans from cardiomyocytes. Graphical results display output from differential expression analysis using Glynsight. Hex (H), HexNAc (N), Fuc (F), and Sia (S) are monosaccharide moieties that form glycan structures. Red and blue bars depict differences in relative abundance. Colored lines indicate the addition of monosaccharide moieties to a given composition. A mixed trend in abundance was observed. Overall changes were indicative of increased complex type structures. B, Volcano plot displaying N-glycan structures that are most signi\ufb01cantly different between isolated cardiomyocytes from each patient group.Multiomics Reveals N-Glycan Alterations in COVID-19 Hearts",
